// The manifest as resource 1 of type RT_MANIFEST (24), which is where the loader looks for an
// executable's own. Configured by CMakeLists.txt so the path is absolute: windres resolves a
// relative one against its working directory, not against this file.
1 24 "@MESHCLIENT_MANIFEST@"

// The application icon, drawn by scripts/gen-icons.py. Explorer and the shortcuts show the
// executable's first icon group, and SDL gives the window the same one, so nothing else names it.
1 ICON "@MESHCLIENT_ICON@"
